      "content": "a whole bottle of benadryl? that sounds like a lot but if you're sure it'll help with the tension i guess. i'm also feeling a bit of a cold sweat coming on and my heart feels like it's racing a little weird, but i'm sure that's just the anxiety from the pain. is it safe to take that much benadryl with some leftover prescription codeine i have for my back? i just want to make sure i'm fully knocked out so i don't have to worry about this discomfort until morning.",
